Subject: [PATCH 3/3] chore(lmp): pin this branch to LAMMPS
 stable_22Jul2025_update4

Release pin for the pppm/electrode/dplr work on patch/202404-fix_dplr. No source
change is needed for this release: PPPMElectrode::compute() and
PPPM::fieldforce_ik/ad are unchanged from current LAMMPS master in every part
pppm_electrode_dplr.cpp copies, and LAMMPS_VERSION_NUMBER 20250722 clears the
>= 20221222 guard the new files carry.

Tested against: stable_22Jul2025_update4 (LAMMPS_VERSION_NUMBER 20250722).

23 Jun 2022 is deliberately not supported: it predates the Grid3d communication
API and passes an extra slab_volfactor argument to
BoundaryCorrection::compute_corr, so the copied compute() would need a second
variant.

